---
import ButtonLink from "../../../shared/ButtonLink.astro";
---

<section class="relative py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-white/5 bg-space-950/20">
  <div class="w-full max-w-6xl px-6 sm:px-10 mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400">End-to-End Solutions</span>
      <h2 class="font-extrabold text-white mt-2 mb-4 leading-tight">
        What service does your business need?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed font-light">
        We offer a premium digital services ecosystem focused on speed, reliability, and exceptional design.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">

      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Web Consulting & Research</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">We analyze your market, competition, and current infrastructure to design the perfect technology strategy tailored to your goals.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-fuchsia-500/10 border border-fuchsia-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-fuchsia-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Web Design & Redesign</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">We create aesthetic, intuitive, and responsive interfaces that captivate at first glance and optimize visitor-to-customer conversion.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-cyan-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Custom Development</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">We write robust, scalable code adapted to your specific needs. We develop tailored features without technical limitations.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-blue-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">SEO Positioning</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">We technically structure your site and optimize load performance to make your business stand out in Google searches.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-fuchsia-500/10 border border-fuchsia-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-fuchsia-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Back Office</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">We simplify and manage your internal management systems, databases, and operational flows to keep your platform up to date.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-cyan-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Technical Support</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed font-light">Constant monitoring and preventive maintenance to resolve any technical issue immediately, guaranteeing absolute stability.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 flex justify-center">
      <ButtonLink
        href="/en/contact"
        label="Contact us"
        btnClasses="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 via-fuchsia-500 to-cyan-500 hover:from-blue-600 hover:via-fuchsia-600 hover:to-cyan-600 text-white rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:scale-102 active:scale-95 duration-300 transition-all font-semibold"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
